      "message": "Since you are moving these out of the end2end tests, can you move these into `libplatform_rutabaga` and give `ANativeWindowHelper`/`Gralloc` the same treatment as the other platform things?\n\nIn `platform/include/ANativeWindowHelper.h`, add a\n\n```\n#if defined(ANDROID)\nANativeWindowHelper* createPlatformANativeWindowHelper(); \n#endif\n```\n\nIn `platform/include/Gralloc.h`, add a\n\n```\n#if defined(ANDROID)\nGralloc* createPlatformGrallocHelper();\n#endif\n```\n\nIIUC, this has the added benefit of being able to hide `TestingAHardwareBuffer` and `TestingANativeWindow`.",
